# Personal host-side wrappers that just invoke `docker build` — local only.
# NOT the actual build: `build.bash` (baked into the ParaView image by
# Dockerfile.paraview) and `fespp/build_scripts/*.sh` (run inside Dockerfile)
# stay tracked. The two-step manual build is documented in README.md.
/build.sh
/build.ps1
/build2.ps1

# FESPP local source (for local build mode)
/fespp-src-local/
# ParaView Trame Components reference sources (not part of the project)
/paraview-trame-components/
# Private docs (Elba deployment, etc.) — local only, excluded from git
doc/private/
# Bilingual user/dev guides — local only (the committed handoff doc is doc/wiki, EN)
doc/EN/
doc/FR/
# French mirror of the developer wiki — local only (the committed wiki is EN)
doc/wiki-fr/
.claude/

# Personal reference notes — accumulated knowledge about ParaView /
# RESQML, kept local so they don't leak into team-wide docs.
/PARAVIEW.md
/RESQML.md
# Personal release smoke-test checklist + downloaded test exports (local)
/cas_de_test_release.csv
/télécharger*.csv
